  "number": 5918,
  "title": "Hide the send box of the Fluent theme when hideSendBox is set",
  "body": "> The Fluent theme ignores `styleOptions.hideSendBox`.\n\n## Changelog Entry\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Fixed the Fluent theme ignoring `styleOptions.hideSendBox`, in PR [#5918](https://github.com/microsoft/BotFramework-WebChat/pull/5918), by [@OEvgeny](https://github.com/OEvgeny)\n\n## Description\n\nThe Fluent theme renders its own send box through `sendBoxMiddleware` and never read `hideSendBox`, so the send box, its toolbar, and suggested actions stayed visible. Fluent's primary send box now renders nothing when `hideSendBox` is `true`, the same as the default theme.\n\n## Specific Changes\n\n- `fluent-theme/src/components/sendBox/SendBox.tsx`: `PrimarySendBox` honors `hideSendBox`\n- `api/src/StyleOptions.ts`: JSDoc for `hideSendBox`\n- `fluentTheme/hideSendBox.html` (+ `.copilot.html`): snapshot 1, the message without send box or suggested actions, in Fluent and Copilot variants\n\n<!-- For bugs, add the bug repro as a test. Otherwise, add tests to futureproof your work. -->\n\n- [x] I have added tests and executed them locally\n- [x] I have added `.changelog/<PR#>-<slug>.md`\n- [ ] I have updated documentation\n\n## Review Checklist\n\n> This section is for contributors to review your work.\n\n- [ ] Accessibility reviewed (tab order, content readability, alt text, color contrast)\n- [ ] Browser and platform compatibilities reviewed\n- [ ] CSS styles reviewed (minimal rules, no `z-index`)\n- [ ] Documents reviewed (docs, samples, live demo)\n- [ ] Internationalization reviewed (strings, unit formatting)\n- [ ] `package.json` and `package-lock.json` reviewed\n- [ ] Security reviewed (no data URIs, check for nonce leak)\n- [ ] Tests reviewed (coverage, legitimacy)\n\n\n",
